  "statuteText": "147-B:14 Transporters Report. –\n\nTransporters of used oil registered under RSA 147-A shall submit annual reports to the department detailing the amount and type of used oil which they handle and such other information as the department may require. The department shall prepare the report forms and establish the submittal date."
